{"id":"d0e3fa6d930415cd","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-hereditary-base-change.md","title":"保持数字的遗传底数提升","display":"df-hereditary-base-change — 保持数字的遗传底数提升","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-hereditary-base-change","aliases":["72-df-hereditary-base-change"],"display":"df-hereditary-base-change — 保持数字的遗传底数提升","depends_on":["[[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]]"],"chapter":"III","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III Definitions5.1–5.2, print191/PDF203; explicit base-change function","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"function composition totality checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-hereditary-base-change"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-hereditary-base-change</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hereditary-base-change — 保持数字的遗传底数提升"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"23689fb4bbf5ac96\" href=\"?note=23689fb4bbf5ac96\" title=\"72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation\">72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III Definitions5.1–5.2, print191/PDF203; explicit base-change function"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"function composition totality checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\\le b\\le c&lt;\\omega\">\\(2\\le b\\le c&lt;\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_c,\\operatorname{Her}_b\">\\(v_c,\\operatorname{Her}_b\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"23689fb4bbf5ac96\" href=\"?note=23689fb4bbf5ac96\" title=\"72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation\">72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Bump}_{b,c}(n):=v_c(\\operatorname{Her}_b(n)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Bump}_{b,c}(n):=v_c(\\operatorname{Her}_b(n)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先完全展开所有指数，再把底数 b 改成 c，全部系数保持不动。指数中出现的底数也必须改变；只改最外层幂的底数不是本定义。定义域明确要求 c≥b，后续的正规性和序数值保持以此为前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"23689fb4bbf5ac96","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"23689fb4bbf5ac96","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$2\\le b\\le c<\\omega$，$n\\in\\omega$；$v_c,\\operatorname{Her}_b$ 使用 [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"2\\le b\\le c<\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"v_c,\\operatorname{Her}_b","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Bump}_{b,c}(n):=v_c(\\operatorname{Her}_b(n)).","display":true}],"bytes":1294,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-114","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-488","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-483","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"},{"id":"8761123b6893eaa5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$b,a,k\\in\\omega$ 且 b≥2；Bump 取 [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]]。$g_b$ 和 $G_{b,a}$ 由下式总函数及自然数递归定义。"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-111","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-heredita